      "comment": "Chang the Ninth: Little Nine",
      "content": "A girl of Qingce Village, also a ninth child, who loved Chang's stories. She vanished long ago; in the World Quest Book in the Woods she searches for a book Big Nine wrote for her, having fallen into the river. Chang believes her parents took her away.\n\nThe wiki reads the quest as showing that she died, a conclusion the quest does not state plainly. Chang is unaware of it.",
