      "comment": "Chang the Ninth: Mr. Nine and Chang",
      "content": "In 6.2 a Seelie called Mr. Nine possessed Chang in his sleep to write stories, burying the royalties in his yard. The Traveler and Fischl visited him for clues, and later dug up the Mora for him.",
