      "comment": "Chang the Ninth: Gentry Maocai's Squeeze",
      "content": "Gentry Maocai, a Liyue merchant, sent Changhu to force Chang to sell Cor Lapis at 30% of market price. Xingqiu defended him and, with the Traveler, ended it.\n\nChanghu returned with thugs and a Fatui Electro Cicin Mage; Xingqiu revealed himself as a Guhua Clan disciple and later fought them.",
